					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#767">Quitting EQ</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							To whomever is left that reads this board any more.. I know I haven't for over two months. I am quitting EQ and guess that means the guild is disbanding. I haven't logged in but once in over two months and am not missing it a bit. I have finally admitted to myself I am wasting money and won't play again. It's been a fun road but I have grown bored of EQ and tired of what it takes to have fun with it. And if it takes effore to have &quot;Fun&quot; then it's not fun any more. Good luck to all of you, and keep having fun.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2605">Jymeejo Flaymblayd</a> at 1:01 PM PST - February 24th, 2003</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
			</table>
			<p>
						<table width="95%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" class="border" border="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#673">Recruiting and New members</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I am currently seeking new membership to rebuild the guild. It has been decided to set a level limit to get in of Lvl 40+ for the main, any alts can definately be lower. Only mains 40+ will be considered, and have the resposibilities as Officers. My alts have officer status only so I can recruit people when needed. Helbound (Muluvyenya's Alt) is also an officer for the same reason.<br />
<br />
My short-term goal for the guild is to be an &quot;Assist&quot; guild for bigger guilds to call on for raids. As of now there are no other guilds that I am familiar with to make this arrangement. But I expect sometime in the near future this happening.<br />
<br />
My long term goal is to have at least two full groups of 50+ characters to conduct minor raids ourselves.<br />
<br />
I personally would like to work for all the officers to have 50+ characters to assist more effectively in almost all zones that they have access to, or can effectivel play in. Personnaly my computer can't handle a lot of the Luclin zones, just way too laggy for me in it's current state.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2605">Jymeejo Flaymblayd</a> at 10:22 AM PST - December 6th, 2002</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
			</table>
			<p>
