					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#477">WELCOME Everyone!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Hello to all that have chosen to assist us in creating a guild on Eci server for the common folk. Hehehe, I will post things here that my characters will be doing and anything I may have to offer from my razings. I often get extra, mundane stuff that would rather give to someone who can use than sell. I hope others will post the same, and get rid of the posts when they are no longer applicable.<br />
<br />
Check through the threads sections as I will post generic topics so we can try to keep some semblance of order.<br />
<br />
Again, thanks to you all and welcome to the family.
						</td>
